00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:42.620
The beach?

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:46.320
Yeah, let's hit the 
beach for our vacation!

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:48.080
It's summer, after all.

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:51.750
This is no time to be 
fixated on relaxing.

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:55.550
Summer is the time to redouble 
our training efforts!

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:58.130
What kind of training is 
that supposed to be?!

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:00.130
Fine.

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:01.930
Hey, Sakura!

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:04.190
Lee doesn't want to come to the beach.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:06.670
Oh, I thought we'd manage 
to get everyone to come...

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:07.830
Everyone?

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:11.480
By the way, are you gonna buy that
swimsuit we saw the other day?

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:13.480
Not sure yet...

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:16.300
That was one sexy swimsuit, huh?

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:18.600
One sexy swimsuit...

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:18.320
<b>Sexy 
Swimsuit!!</b>

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:21.700
Sexy swimsuit...

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:22.420
<i>S-S-Sexy swimsuit...</i>

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:25.060
See you at the store!

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:26.060
Okay.

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:27.470
Tenten!

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:31.040
I can train at the beach.

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:34.460
You're not dressed for training!

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:37.060
<i>I want to see...</i>

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:38.850
<i>...Sakura's new swimsuit!</i>

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:44.390
He's overheating!

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:54.440
<b>Summer Means Seashell Styles!</b>

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.790
Ow, ow, ow!

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:02.360
Expansion Jutsu!

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:05.170
Bushy-Brows?

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:09.080
Why so glum?

00:03:09.470 --> 00:03:11.740
What's the matter, Bushy-Brows?!

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:13.730
Your face is all strained!

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:17.170
I'm... a little dizzy...

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.890
Car sick?

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:20.070
Should we get some medicine?

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:22.300
No, I don't want to have to stop.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:27.220
My love will ride the 
southern wind of youth,

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:30.030
and run gaily across the sands!

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:33.910
You're not sick. 
You're drunk off your own fantasies!

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:36.940
Because...

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:41.320
Sakura bought a sexy swimsuit!

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:46.380
My fantasy soars through
the azure winds of my heart,

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.560
and runs smoothly over the ocean,

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:49.720
all the way to the distant islands!

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:50.440
No, no!

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:51.900
Jet pack swimsuits don't exist!

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:52.950
It's an awesome idea,

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:54.430
