swimsuit will be so incredible.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.300
Naruto, Konohamaru, you know 
where I'm coming from, right?

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:06.200
I won't say I do,
but I won't say I don't.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:09.190
