00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:16.010
Those are natural materials!

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:18.550
Wait, why the heck are 
you wearing that?!

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:21.400
I felt shells were standard summer fare.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.010
There's nothing standard about that!

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:24.400
Only supermodels wear shells,

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.200
