00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.710
Guy Sensei!

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:32.700
Lee!

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:33.580
Whoo!

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.670
Why are you both changing on the bus?!

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:42.920
Hey, Lee, how do I look?

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:50.240
Wh-What?

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:52.760
Nothing at all.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:53.640
Where's Sakura?

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:55.420
Lee-san!

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:58.360
Sakura's sexy swimsuit...

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:01.520
...is underwater!

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:05.000
