00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:09.560
Oh! I see we're training already.

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:11.500
What are you, a busty swimsuit model?

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.700
How many outfits did you bring, anyway?!

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:15.960
I heard everything, Lee.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.540
<i>I can train at the beach.</i>

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:23.290
As your teacher, I'm thrilled 
to see such dedication!

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:26.400
As your student, I wish you'd 
wear a normal swimsuit!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:28.640
I'm going to make things 
tough on you today, Lee.

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:32.530
5,000 laps around the 
beach, on your hands!

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:36.350
That's going beyond sexy and 
becoming a test of sheer will!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:37.610
Follow me, Lee!

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:39.410
Y-Yes sir!

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:41.070
You came all the way 
to the beach for this?

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:42.870
<i>Shoot.</i>

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.210
<i>We just started training...</i>

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:47.490
<i>I've gotta find a way to 
check out Sakura's swimsuit－</i>

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:49.930
Lee! Don't zone out!

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:53.360
At this pace, the sun will set
before we do our 5,000 laps!

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.140
R-Right...

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:58.690
<i>I want to see Sakura's swimsuit so badly,</i>

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:01.470
<i>but I can't let Guy Sensei down.</i>

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:02.680
<i>I...</i>

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:04.220
<i>I just have to finish training fast,</i>

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:06.840
<i>so I have time to see what she's wearing!</i>

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:16.200
This looks good.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:21.690
Sakura's sexy swimsuit!

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.230
This is a crazy pace, Lee!

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:26.110
After this, we'll jump right 
into our next training!

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:31.070
Faster!

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:33.850
Ride the south wind to success!

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:37.530
Sakura's sexy swimsuit!

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:45.640
Much too slow!

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:49.430
You'll never fry 5,000 servings of
noodles in one day like that!

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:50.470
Sakura's sexy swimsuit!

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:52.800
Hot! Hot!

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:59.950
Bushy-Brows really wants to
check out Sakura's outfit, huh?

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:02.410
What's so great about swimsuits, anyway?

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:06.110
I don't get why he's that 
worked up about it, myself.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:07.820
Still...

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:12.130
I kinda feel bad for him, you know?

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:15.800
I wish we could help Mr. 
Bushy-Brows out somehow.

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:17.790
Let's do what we can!

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:23.810
