00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.890
Sakura's sexy swim－

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:28.720
Guy Sensei, what's that?

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:34.010
<i>Naruto, are you sure this'll work?</i>

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.710
<i>Definitely!</i>

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:37.690
<i>If a hot-blooded man like Guy Sensei</i>

