00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:58.780
I don't think this watermelon survival 
race will be that difficult－

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:00.050
Think again, Tenten.

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:00.570
Huh?

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:05.760
The beach is littered with 
traps unique to the summer.

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:08.000
Summer traps?

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.150
Take a look, shing!

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:11.300
Shing...

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:14.060
<i>If I went straight through the water...</i>

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.930
<i>It'd be a shortcut to the watermelon.</i>

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:21.130
<i>But I'd be a sitting duck trying</i>

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:23.150
<i>to navigate through this crowd.</i>

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:26.940
<i>I'll have to move carefully.</i>

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:27.640
You see now?!

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:34.250
Normal summer beach happenings become
traps in a watermelon survival race!

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:35.050
You're right!

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:40.810
A ninja could easily hide himself
in this big crowd of beach-goers.

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:42.880
They've gotta move carefully!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:48.320
Oh ho, while we've been talking,
someone's fallen into a trap!

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:50.100
Huh?! It's not Lee, is it－

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:50.880
You freak!

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:54.180
Choji looks like he's in pain,

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.350
what happened?!

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:57.550
I ate too much yakisoba and 
fried squid and hot dogs and...

00:15:57.550 --> 00:15:59.580
...juice and snow cones and ice cream,

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:02.050
and now my stomach hurts!

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:04.310
Hurry up, hurry up!

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:04.310
You just overate?!

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:07.020
What's wrong with you?!

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:08.670
Hurry...

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:10.740
Gotcha, Choji!

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:20.370
That was a summer beach trap?

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:21.190
One must be careful,

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:23.360
overeat in the summer, get diarrhea.

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:26.420
That is the first of the 
beach's traps, shing!

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:29.790
I know you're trying to be 
cool, but it's not working.

00:16:30.530 --> 00:16:32.830
We've got some movement 
in the snack hut.

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:34.510
Hey, you!

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:37.070
Take off the funny hat and get to work!

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:38.870
What?! I don't work here—

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:41.780
You kids today are such whiners!

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:43.140
No, I really don't－

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:47.400
So troublesome.

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:50.290
One must be careful,
 feeding the big summer crowd,

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:51.420
demands many hands!

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:52.460
Shing!

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:55.360
That's the restaurant's problem...

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:58.780
What's with this girl?
 She's been by herself the whole time.

00:16:59.340 --> 00:17:02.090
She must be lonely, 
hanging at the beach all alone.

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:04.790
She must still be chasing an ex.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:07.420
So sad, she's wasting a 
perfectly good summer day!

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:11.810
Hey, I'm not doing this 
because I enjoy it!

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:13.080
You're open!

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:16.260
Complacency is your enemy!

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:17.530
One must be careful.

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:20.260
The youth is greener on the other side, 
of the summer fence!

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:21.470
Shing!

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.930
That one wasn't a haiku. 
It didn't even make sense!

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:25.390
It's a warning, when you see other...

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:26.970
...couples being lovey-dovey at the beach,

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:28.430
it can make you so 
jealous that you'll run...

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:31.610
...straight into the arms of the 
first guy who'll have you.

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:32.130
Shing!

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:33.240
Shut up!

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.490
The watermelon's all mine!

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:39.950
I'm sorry－

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:46.960
<i>Wow, she's gorgeous.</i>

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:58.610
That was cold!

00:17:58.610 --> 00:17:59.850
Nice job, Neji!

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:03.960
Every time... Why does it 
always have to be me...

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:05.900
Smart, Lee.

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:07.610
You and Neji teamed up, well done.

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:08.800
That must be their

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:11.120
"One must be careful,
the alluring summer girls,

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:13.850
always break your heart"
counter-strategy.

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:15.340
Counter-strategy?

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:18.400
None of this is remotely like 
real traps or survival!

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:21.550
Please, love is all about survival.

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:22.500
Shing!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:25.000
Shing, shing, shing, shing, enough!

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:27.140
<i>What now?</i>

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.960
<i>Right now we're in a stalemate.</i>

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:31.580
<i>The crowd is the problem.</i>

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:32.920
<i>Man, this ramen's good!</i>

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:36.120
<i>There's no telling where Naruto 
and Shikamaru will attack from.</i>

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:37.830
<i>I've got to clear a path...</i>

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:41.390
<i>Forgive me, Neji.
I just had a great idea.</i>

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:44.510
The survival race has 
entered its final stage.

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:49.280
It's down to Lee, Neji, 
Naruto and Shikamaru.

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:50.450
Oh no, over there!

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:53.620
Lee!

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:56.540
Hey, wake up!

00:18:58.680 --> 00:18:59.750
What happened?!

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:03.870
I-I got in too deep...

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:08.810
Yes... she was beautiful.

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:11.720
She appeared before me 
as if out of a dream...

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:17.630
And said she wanted an emerald
more beautiful than the ocean.

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.180
Wait, what?

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:25.360
I spent all my savings to
buy her an emerald that...

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:27.680
...sparkled brighter than the seven seas.

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:30.600
What is this? I don't get it!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:35.500
But then, she'd rather 
have a yellow diamond...

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:38.110
...that shone brighter than the sun,

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:41.540
and left me for another man.

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:46.210
I lost everything...

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:48.480
...when I lost her...

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:51.140
You fool, so you fell into the ocean?!

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:52.650
Were you trying to drown yourself?!

00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:53.820
Wait, you said you fell!

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:55.630
You meant you fell in love?!

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:57.770
Everyone, let us though!

00:19:57.770 --> 00:19:59.550
Please move!

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:04.220
This lovesick fool needs 
medical attention!

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:06.510
<i>And here I am again!</i>

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:09.340
Wow, it worked!

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:12.130
The crowd dispersed. It's a 
straight shot to the watermelon!

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:14.360
Finally!

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:19.930
<i>Naruto...</i>

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:22.380
You won't get past us!

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:23.800
Well played, Bushy-Brows.

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:26.680
But just because you made 
a shortcut to the goal,

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:28.620
doesn't mean you've beaten me－

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:36.760
You guys are really making me work. 
This is so troublesome!

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:40.900
Then the race is on!

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:42.000
Lee, you backstabber!

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:42.550
Shoot!

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:46.680
First one to the watermelon wins!

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:56.040
Goal!

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:08.740
It's a fake...

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:13.020
They're so naive.

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:15.570
But it was good training!

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:20.540
Looks like I won the watermelon today!

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:21.660
I see.

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:23.630
He just wanted the whole 
thing for himself.

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:29.200
One must be careful,
not only of summer traps,

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:30.390
but of Sensei's smooth talk.

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:36.950
Goal!

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:38.430
One must be careful.

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:42.320
The revelry of summer, 
and the excitement.

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:44.290
I'm sorry...

00:23:21.190 --> 00:23:22.380
Yikes!

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:25.130
Next week is "I want to 
be friends with Gaara!"

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:27.840
<b>I want to be friends with Gaara!
The Rock Lee Impostor Strikes!</b>

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:27.840
and "The Rock Lee Impostor Strikes!"

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:30.640
Apparently someone's going 
around impersonating me!

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:31.510
Oh no!

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:33.470
What's he doing while 
dressed up like you?

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:34.360
Well,

00:23:34.360 --> 00:23:37.910
he's pestering the other village ninjas
to join his ridiculous training methods,

00:23:37.910 --> 00:23:41.530
doing random skits at inappropriate
times in inappropriate places,

00:23:41.530 --> 00:23:44.920
and finally, confessing his love 
to Sakura and getting rejected!

00:23:44.920 --> 00:23:46.860
It's awful, just awful!

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:48.860
How is he different from the real you?
